\
}",
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 200002,
            ["TalkActionId"] = {
                [1] = "200002:Shock_Start",
                },
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/101087/194E5B16",
            },
        [10108705] = {
            ["Content"] = "（这是一个漂亮的雕花匣子，拿在手中沉甸甸的。但正如白所言，里面空无一物。）",
            ["ContentKR"] = "(꽃이 조각된 예쁜 상자는 묵직했다. 하지만 스노우의 말처럼 그 안은 텅 비어 있었다.)",
            ["DialogueId"] = 10108705,
            ["DisableMouth"] = 1,
            ["GUID"] = "194E5B40",
            ["IsBlack"] = 1,
            ["NextDialogue"] = 10108706,
            ["Scripts"] = "PARA{\
MoveTo{ActorId{100001},TargetPoint{\"P10108706\"},MoveSpeed{100},Visibility{\"Show\"}},\
PlayNormalSound{EventPath{\"event:/sfx/common/story/01/openbox\"},PlayAs2D{true}}\
}",
            ["TalkActionId"] = {
                [1] = "200002:Shock_End",
                },
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/101087/194E5B40",
            },
        [10108706] = {
            ["Content"] = "（不，并不是空无一物！而是还残留着什么。那似乎是<H>一些湿滑的粉末</>——像未溶解的盐粒，大部分已经散入水中，但还留了一小部分残留在匣底。）",
            ["ContentKR"] = "(아니, 텅 빈 게 아니었다! 뭔가 남아 있었다. <H>젖어버린 가루</> 같았다. 다 녹지 못한 소금 알갱이처럼, 대부분이 이미 물속으로 흩어졌지만 일부는 상자 밑에 여전히 남아있었다.)",
            ["DialogueId"] = 10108706,
            ["DisableMouth"] = 1,
            ["FacialId"] = {
                [1] = "200002:None",
                },
            ["GUID"] = "194E5B6A",
            ["IsBlack"] = 1,
            ["LookAt"] = {
                [1] = "200002:p(P10108701)",
                [2] = "100001:n(100001)",
                },
            ["NextDialogue"] = 10108707,
            ["TurnTo"] = {
                [1] = "100001:p(22)",
                },
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/101087/194E5B6A",
            },
        [10108707] = {
            ["Camera"] = "98.9375,-272.827148,113.293945,0.001215,-14.999996,19.799967,30.0,100000.0,false,DoNotOverride,2.8",
            ["Content"] = "不……不是空的。它之前装了东西，应该是……一种粉末。",
            ["ContentKR"] = "아니... 비어있는 게 아니야. 무언가 담겨 있었어. 아마... 가루였을 거야.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 10108707,
            ["ExStoryInfo"] = "Player",
            ["FacialId"] = {
                [1] = "100001:Doubt01",
                },
            ["FinalCamera"] = "127.741211,-262.455078,99.574707,0.001215,-14.999996,19.799967,30.0,100000.0,false,DoNotOverride,2.8",
            ["GUID"] = "194E5B94",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 10108708,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 100001,
            ["TalkActionId"] = {
                [1] = "100001:Think_Start",
                },
            ["ToFinalCameraBlendTime"] = 10,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/101087/194E5B94",
            },
        [10108708] = {
            ["Camera"] = "-329.612305,-177.105469,446.131836,0.000077,-32.799988,-2.399903,50.0,508.578156,false,DoNotOverride,2.8",
            ["Content"] = "啊，粉末……为什么恩里克要跑那么远，把一盒粉末放水里？这也太奇怪了。",
            ["ContentKR"] = "가루... 왜 헨릭은 이렇게 멀리까지 와서 가루가 든 상자를 물에 버리는 거지? 너무 이상해.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 10108708,
            ["FacialId"] = {
                [1] = "200002:Unhappy01",
                },
            ["FinalCamera"] = "-356.851562,-176.12793,432.189941,0.000077,-30.399866,-1.799865,50.0,508.578156,false,DoNotOverride,2.8",
            ["GUID"] = "194E5BBE",
            ["LookAt"] = {
                [1] = "200002:n(100001)",
                },
            ["NextDialogue"] = 10108709,
            ["Scripts"] = "PlayAnimation{_delay{3.2},ActorId{200002},AnimationId{\"Talk02_Start\"},Duration{1}}",
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 200002,
            ["ToFinalCameraBlendTime"] = 8,
            ["TurnTo"] = {
                [1] = "200002:p(-45)",
                },
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/101087/194E5BBE",
            },
        [10108709] = {
            ["Camera"] = "368.069336,-158.992188,93.618164,0.000123,6.400003,-133.601913,50.0,114.843842,false,Manual,8.0",
            ["Content"] = "不知道……但是，我总觉得有些不舒服。我们先回去，看看奥特赛德那边的情况吧。",
            ["ContentKR"] = "글쎄... 하지만 뭔가 불안해. 일단 돌아가서 아웃사이더 쪽 상황을 봐야겠어.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 10108709,
            ["ExStoryInfo"] = "Player",
            ["GUID"] = "194E5BE8",
            ["LookAt"] = {
                [1] = "100001:n(100001)",
                },
            ["Scripts"] = "SEQ{\
PlayAnimation{_delay{0.4},ActorId{100001},AnimationId{\"DisagreeHead\"},Duration{2.8}},\
PlayAnimation{ActorId{100001},AnimationId{\"Sigh_Start\"},Duration{2.8}},\
